From 2fc9473ecedc79d7daf6607f17eb9a247af4fea9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:58:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Incursions: overview beacons, acceleration gates and pockets,
 wiki site mechanics, Sansha EWAR, Journal tab

Sites
- Every site is a global beacon (overview, no scanning) with one or two
  acceleration gates beside it.  Gates lead to pockets about 1e9 m away,
  each with its own beacon; a pocket spawns when the first pilot arrives.
  Completed sites drop their beacon at once (SystemManager::RemoveGlobalBall)
  and go a minute after the last pilot leaves.
- incSiteObjects gains room, role, param and itemName.  Roles: wave ship,
  free ship, objective, pick-one objective, respawning group, scenery, gate,
  hidden gate, container, asteroid.  New IncursionSites.cpp holds the room
  engine and each site's script (refinery Lyavite, OTA logistics station and
  hackable arrays, NCS commander kill and warp-off, NCN class-checked gates
  that unlock each other, OCF civilians and evacuation freighter, TCRC
  battletower repairs, MTAC factory and control tower, uncloaked trigger and
  respawning groups, TPPH hidden gates and Mobile Headquarters, mothership
  reinforcements, logistics hack, nexus and relay).
- KeeperService::ActivateAccelerationGate hands incursion gates to
  IncursionMgr::UseGate; Prospector reports data analyzer hacks, mining
  lasers and drones report mined ore.
- Mothership only after an HQ site completes at zero influence and the
  incursion has passed MothershipDelayHigh/Low hours; influence regen stops
  after that.  Kundalini in high and null-sec, Uroborus in low-sec only.
- LP goes into incLPPool and is paid when the mothership dies (DelayedLP).
- Per-type site limits: VanguardSites, AssaultSites, HQSites.

NPCs
- NPCEwar.cpp: incursion ships orbit at entityFlyRange at cruise speed, run
  propulsion with signature bloom to close or chase, pick targets on grid,
  and use warp disruptors, webs, neuts, ECM, painters, remote shield
  repairs (npcAssistanceRange, up to 3 targets), the Vylade shield link and
  the motherships' remote ECM burst.  ClearEwar on death and removal.
- NPCAIMgr::LeaveGrid warps a ship off for site scripts.
- DestinyManager keeps a web factor so webs survive speed recalculation.

Journal and starmap
- MapService GetIncursionGlobalReport and GetSystemsInIncursions(GM) return
  live data; new rewardMgr service answers GetDelayedRewardsByGroupIDs.

EVEmu fixes
- Acceleration gates warped with the jump length as the warp-to range.
- Inventory::List filtered space container contents by the viewer's owner.
- Mission containers now load as CargoContainer.
- Prospector only turns wrecks into loot containers.
- IsWreckTypeID accepts 3260, the Sansha supercarrier wreck.

Database: sql/migrations/20261012180000-incursions-sites.sql (site layouts,
new columns, incLPPool, objective and container stats, assistance and ECM
burst ranges).
